## 3. Configuration Structures

### Profile `config.yaml` Sample:
```yaml
model:
  default: stepfun/step-3.7-flash:free
  provider: nous
  base_url: https://inference-api.nousresearch.com/v1
  context_length: 131072
  reasoning_effort: high
providers:
  ollama:
    api_key: ollama
    base_url: http://localhost:11434/v1
fallback_providers: '["gemini"]'
```

### Profile `.env` Sample:
```env
GOOGLE_API_KEY=GOOGLE_API_KEY=[REDACTED-2026-10-02]
GEMINI_API_KEY=GOOGLE_API_KEY=[REDACTED-2026-10-02]
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=OPENROUTER_API_KEY=[REDACTED-2026-10-02]
```
*(Note: Per-profile config files in `/profiles/<name>/config.yaml` take precedence over the global `/config.yaml` file).*